{{!
    @template tool_vae/sources

    The certification records of the site on the administration screen: a heading, then the table of the records (code
    and provenance, name, register, competencies and divergences, declarations, last import).

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\sources. The template holds no logic. Two keys
    are HTML (triple braces): headinghtml, a heading made by the core ($output->heading()); tablehtml, a table drawn by
    the template tool_vae/table (its texts are escaped by the templates tool_vae/cell_content, tool_vae/source_code and
    tool_vae/provenance).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * headinghtml - HTML, the heading of the table
    * tablehtml - HTML, the table of the records

    Example context (json):
    {
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Certification records</h3>",
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable tool-vae-sources\"><tbody><tr><td>RNCP36832</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
